[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unitlabel3dshaded"]

; The one variable: `shaded`, which lights a Label3D with the scene's lights
; (`SHADING_MODE_PER_PIXEL`, `material.cpp:3045`). An unshaded label, a shaded label and a shaded
; label turned to show its back face stand under one coloured sun at N·L = 0.5. The back face takes
; the flipped normal (`scene_forward_clustered.glsl:1263-1266`), so it is lit as the front.

